  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "AI Agent 帮得越多，人的判断力为什么可能越弱？先别把思考外包出去。",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 5.64,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.17,
      "spokenEnd": 4.991,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Microsoft Research 把两种角色分得很清楚。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 4.99,
      "spokenStart": 5.151,
      "spokenEnd": 7.613,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "助手模式追求更快完成，思考工具模式则用张力、替代解释和追问，帮助人继续理解问题。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.248,
      "audioStart": 7.551,
      "spokenStart": 7.713,
      "spokenEnd": 14.156,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "现有研究呈现的是混合结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.52,
      "audioStart": 14.158,
      "spokenStart": 14.316,
      "spokenEnd": 16.04,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "AI 可能提高眼前产出，也可能让想法变窄、批判性投入减少，或者让人过后更难保留刚才学到的内容。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.752,
      "audioStart": 15.977,
      "spokenStart": 16.14,
      "spokenEnd": 23.081,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这期不劝你远离 AI。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.136,
      "audioStart": 23.072,
      "spokenStart": 23.241,
      "spokenEnd": 24.55,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "我们要做一张思考保留卡，让效率和判断不再是二选一，并且把研究原型与我们的实践推导清楚分开。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.488,
      "audioStart": 24.478,
      "spokenStart": 24.65,
      "spokenEnd": 31.321,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 31.324,
      "spokenStart": 31.481,
      "spokenEnd": 37.253,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第一步不是挑模型，而是说清楚这次工作真正要保留哪一种人的思考。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.184,
      "audioStart": 37.275,
      "spokenStart": 37.433,
      "spokenEnd": 41.824,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果任务只是改格式、找错字或整理已经确定的字段，目标主要是可靠完成，助手模式通常很合适。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.584,
      "audioStart": 41.819,
      "spokenStart": 41.984,
      "spokenEnd": 48.767,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果任务要求形成观点、理解因果、比较证据或承担后果，那么独立判断本身就是交付物的一部分。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.416,
      "audioStart": 48.765,
      "spokenStart": 48.927,
      "spokenEnd": 55.554,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这时先写一句人的学习目标。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.352,
      "audioStart": 55.551,
      "spokenStart": 55.714,
      "spokenEnd": 57.285,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "比如我必须能解释为什么选这个方案，而不是只拿到一份看起来完整的推荐。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.688,
      "audioStart": 57.219,
      "spokenStart": 57.385,
      "spokenEnd": 62.255,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "再标出最容易被外包的环节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.688,
      "audioStart": 62.267,
      "spokenStart": 62.415,
      "spokenEnd": 64.323,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "提出假设、发现反例、权衡价值和解释不确定性，往往比润色文字更值得保留。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.528,
      "audioStart": 64.265,
      "spokenStart": 64.423,
      "spokenEnd": 70.154,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Microsoft 的综述提醒我们，低风险的 AI 审阅也可能让人检查得更不认真，因为系统输出很容易被当成默认答案。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.304,
      "audioStart": 70.16,
      "spokenStart": 70.314,
      "spokenEnd": 77.809,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "所以先做一个最小独立尝试。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.64,
      "audioStart": 77.822,
      "spokenStart": 77.969,
