      "id": "c03-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "哪些证据缺失，哪个假设一旦为假，当前方案就不再成立。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 123.634,
      "spokenStart": 123.793,
      "spokenEnd": 127.56,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Microsoft 介绍的原型正是在尝试这些机制，包括突出张力、呈现替代视角和给出探究性问题。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.032,
      "audioStart": 127.561,
      "spokenStart": 127.72,
      "spokenEnd": 133.956,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
