      "audioDuration": 3.528,
      "audioStart": 144.985,
      "spokenStart": 145.143,
      "spokenEnd": 147.881,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三步是把推理过程留在桌面上，而不是只保存最终答案。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.584,
      "audioStart": 147.903,
      "spokenStart": 148.061,
      "spokenEnd": 151.842,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "先记录初始判断和置信度。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.616,
      "audioStart": 151.843,
      "spokenStart": 152.002,
      "spokenEnd": 153.801,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "之后 AI 给出什么都不要覆盖原文，而是在旁边追加变化和原因。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.944,
      "audioStart": 153.733,
      "spokenStart": 153.901,
      "spokenEnd": 158.034,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
