      "id": "c04-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "能否用自己的话解释因果链，是检查理解和保留度的简单方法。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.68,
      "audioStart": 180.061,
      "spokenStart": 180.22,
      "spokenEnd": 184.086,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这套过程不会消除偏差，但它让人和 AI 的影响路径可审查，也让下次复盘不必猜发生了什么。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.768,
      "audioStart": 184.082,
      "spokenStart": 184.246,
      "spokenEnd": 190.22,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 190.226,
      "spokenStart": 190.38,
      "spokenEnd": 191.065,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，保留初始判断和每次改动。",
