      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "凡是涉及价值取舍、不可逆影响、他人权益或公开承诺，都不应该因为 AI 给出高置信度就自动通过。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.752,
      "audioStart": 202.572,
      "spokenStart": 202.723,
      "spokenEnd": 209.677,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "人工关口不只是点击确认。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.544,
      "audioStart": 209.68,
      "spokenStart": 209.837,
      "spokenEnd": 211.581,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "负责人必须看到备选项、主要证据、剩余不确定性和最坏可接受后果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.568,
      "audioStart": 211.536,
      "spokenStart": 211.681,
      "spokenEnd": 216.475,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "对于低风险、可回滚的步骤，可以让 Agent 执行并留下日志。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.656,
      "audioStart": 216.474,
      "spokenStart": 216.635,
      "spokenEnd": 220.487,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "风险升高时，再切换到建议模式。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.024,
      "audioStart": 220.429,
      "spokenStart": 220.587,
      "spokenEnd": 222.799,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把责任写进流程。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.848,
      "audioStart": 222.798,
      "spokenStart": 222.959,
      "spokenEnd": 224,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "谁定义成功，谁批准例外，谁在结果变坏时负责停止，不能只写由 AI 辅助。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.88,
      "audioStart": 223.941,
      "spokenStart": 224.1,
      "spokenEnd": 229.166,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "还要检查一种隐性风险。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.28,
      "audioStart": 229.161,
      "spokenStart": 229.326,
      "spokenEnd": 230.791,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "系统越像一个可靠同事，人越容易在疲劳时减少审查，这正是低投入使用最需要防守的地方。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.224,
      "audioStart": 230.736,
      "spokenStart": 230.891,
      "spokenEnd": 237.317,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "好的 AI 工作流不是处处插入人工，而是把稀缺注意力放在真正决定方向和后果的节点。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.456,
      "audioStart": 237.318,
      "spokenStart": 237.477,
      "spokenEnd": 243.133,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 243.139,
      "spokenStart": 243.293,
      "spokenEnd": 243.978,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，价值与不可逆决策保留人工关口。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.432,
      "audioStart": 243.918,
      "spokenStart": 244.078,
      "spokenEnd": 246.707,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，确认必须包含证据、未知项和后果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.6,
      "audioStart": 246.709,
      "spokenStart": 246.867,
      "spokenEnd": 249.662,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，把人的注意力集中在改变方向的节点。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.504,
      "audioStart": 249.667,
      "spokenStart": 249.822,
      "spokenEnd": 252.534,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "最后，把前面的规则压缩成一张四栏思考保留卡。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.32,
      "audioStart": 252.566,
      "spokenStart": 252.714,
      "spokenEnd": 256.249,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第一栏写人的目标。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.8,
      "audioStart": 256.254,
      "spokenStart": 256.409,
      "spokenEnd": 257.439,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这次必须形成什么理解、判断或可迁移能力，不能只写完成一份文档。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.352,
      "audioStart": 257.379,
      "spokenStart": 257.539,
      "spokenEnd": 262.092,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二栏写 AI 的角色。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.04,
      "audioStart": 262.097,
      "spokenStart": 262.252,
      "spokenEnd": 263.497,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "让它整理、质疑、比较还是执行，并标明禁止替代的思考环节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.304,
      "audioStart": 263.448,
      "spokenStart": 263.597,
      "spokenEnd": 268.12,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三栏写证据动作。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.992,
      "audioStart": 268.126,
      "spokenStart": 268.28,
      "spokenEnd": 269.501,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "列出原始来源、最强反证、仍未知的变量，以及什么新证据会改变结论。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.592,
      "audioStart": 269.438,
      "spokenStart": 269.601,
      "spokenEnd": 274.405,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第四栏写人工关口。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.944,
      "audioStart": 274.41,
      "spokenStart": 274.565,
      "spokenEnd": 275.71,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "谁在何时决定继续、回滚或公开，并记录决定后的理由。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 275.653,
      "spokenStart": 275.81,
      "spokenEnd": 279.435,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "使用顺序是先独立尝试，再让 AI 暴露张力，接着比较证据，最后由人做带理由的判断。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.384,
      "audioStart": 279.433,
      "spokenStart": 279.595,
      "spokenEnd": 285.183,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这张卡是对 Microsoft 文章原则的实践化整理，不是其官方模板。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.68,
      "audioStart": 285.173,
      "spokenStart": 285.343,
      "spokenEnd": 289.213,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "它的价值在于让思考是否被保留变得可见。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.624,
      "audioStart": 289.155,
      "spokenStart": 289.313,
      "spokenEnd": 292.132,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 292.138,
      "spokenStart": 292.292,
      "spokenEnd": 292.976,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，先写人的学习与判断目标。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.928,
      "audioStart": 292.915,
      "spokenStart": 293.076,
      "spokenEnd": 295.2,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，为 AI 指定角色、证据动作和禁止区。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.056,
      "audioStart": 295.202,
      "spokenStart": 295.36,
      "spokenEnd": 298.621,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用具名人工关口完成最终取舍。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 298.623,
      "spokenStart": 298.781,
      "spokenEnd": 301.466,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把整套方法串起来：先辨认不能外包的思考，再让 AI 暴露张力，留下推理痕迹，最后守住人工判断关口。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 7.584,
      "audioStart": 301.478,
      "spokenStart": 301.646,
      "spokenEnd": 308.426,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "效率不是敌人。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 308.428,
      "spokenStart": 308.586,
      "spokenEnd": 309.478,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "真正的风险是用更快的答案替代了本来需要形成的理解，却没有意识到交付物已经变了。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 309.413,
      "spokenStart": 309.578,
      "spokenEnd": 315.324,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "下一次打开 AI 前，先写四行：人的目标、AI 的角色、证据动作、人工关口。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.264,
      "audioStart": 315.326,
      "spokenStart": 315.484,
      "spokenEnd": 320.971,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "然后再开始对话。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 320.917,
      "spokenStart": 321.071,
      "spokenEnd": 322.042,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "关注 Tiny Agent，成为更擅长使用 AI 的人！",
